# Placeholder so this directory survives git and is carried by the template copy.
#
# `sites/` supports the MONOREPO topology (B): head apps live at sites/<head-app>/
# inside the authoring solution, and xmcloud.build.json carries BOTH
# renderingHosts.<key>.path = "./sites/<head-app>" AND authoringPath = "./authoring".
#
# The default topology (A) puts each head app in its own repo as a sibling of cm/,
# leaving this directory unused. See ../README.md for the field-by-field difference.
